{
  "module": "kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "73d625b71d360dd08c5c5ddfd3025acb",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec1",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "b5b0fc31c72f2226620013e1048dd8a703e837286d98f0ee0caf8feca9f7cc3d",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "シュヴァルグラン登場！：「抜錨」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8a5465e271e62aa418440c345914071d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec1",
        "lines",
        6
      ],
      "originalHash": "5d40adca4bd88164dc3d0b7c74b0b3069af48412c60730fd12db8e260cb4d640",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "正直……遺失物係に出せばよかった。それがいちばん確実だ。探しているあいだに相手が遺失物係へ行けば、%YOU%の余計な真似は逆効果になる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cd82e17e4005a0066bfb351d6df0fed3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec1",
        "lines",
        10
      ],
      "originalHash": "23bd15b3ba08bbc2a656c8d22aff2be3cc334760434f90d344f3f3d4cd0ce4f0",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "さっきの呟きが、ふいに頭に浮かぶ。すれ違っただけの見知らぬ%UMA%なのに、なぜこれほど気になる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c82318adb5d87d12e9373962e8bbcce2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec1",
        "lines",
        20
      ],
      "originalHash": "e737b1714c378dbe38c665c9db5f3a33c97fb1195e763716de50c4053aee17c0",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "%YOU%は乾いた笑いをこぼす。同じ場所へ逃げてきたのか、運命の出会いなのか。だがすぐ首を横に振る——",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a0d82302ea87ed5f40ca391f7443edba",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "6a5bcb5c317328ec0814a28ae93dedb28a54479269e9acdfc79c8bcb3d8102b3",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "シュヴァルグラン登場！：「入海」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "be6cad2fa0153bcf1a84d446813c73d1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "3763326095b05be827f4d90546abb30d768c08a764c731112e8cc98501c642c1",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "今日の募集戦に出た%UMA%以外、生徒の訓練場使用は禁じられている。まばらな場内を見渡せば、あの白い海軍帽はすぐ見つかった——ベンチのそばではなく、コースの上だ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "89f2bf6943feca905227d14a26356be1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        6
      ],
      "originalHash": "dbc8983e3931ce47a71f0a6b657fb4f175b017248031ae0bd74f459a0c8b81a6",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "短髪の%UMA%の額から大粒の汗が落ち、数滴が薄く赤らんだ頬を伝い、顎で水の粒になる。汗に濡れた栗色の短髪が首筋に貼りついている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cefb5dcfa31b3cb6cac5b0a6629064b9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        11
      ],
      "originalHash": "46e5d5bafc817feda253f700bd714d4c79ef1f9b2e74c9bff9c3a24d32b3ea3c",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "募集戦での%SEX%の走りを思い出す。案の定、いま往復しているのは、位置取りで負けたあの区間だ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0b16b9f3dc658baa81618ae6ef925bfc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        23
      ],
      "originalHash": "b6d4c49b3ad72b96b4043c205320402f8265e3198c1f1af1d5319b225a98be48",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "負けず嫌いな姿には心を動かされる。だが、こんな報復じみたトレーニングは、自分を傷つけるだけだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7b74bf4815e1771b6aecdcb5c7defa30",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        24
      ],
      "originalHash": "d042f83267b557b94095c385db05cb08b8d40833ac00f49249e0fbf94826dd9f",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "止めに入ろうとした、そのとき——",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "92b30c15fbc7fd44c01d6459615a0972",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        52
      ],
      "originalHash": "2aa278b6b6ca9ebab9757cbaf590df1899d4a000f5ab18a6153b3084d67bca71",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "その様子を見て、%VIVLOS%は急いで寄り、今度は直接%SEX%の腕に抱きついた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "080fbe6ae5eaeb6fea595eff93f80374",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        58,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "d0d60d52f4423172af770dfb68e16f78e014df89eff1af93c4a6844e932aa288",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "「なんでよ～～！ あたし、シュヴァお姉ちゃんの学園の話も聞きたかったのに～ %91_CALL_90%！ お姉ちゃんも説得してよ～！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "600d1299ad0615d3c7c5198ea1dcd0e7",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        63
      ],
      "originalHash": "993054cc4f4af8c285977e1a5268e33740d566e5cd83b369c07daee25f476abc",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "何か飲み込み、%VERXINA%は%VIVLOS%の肩を抱いて向きを変え、%CHARA%の肩を慰めるように叩いた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b4a7d42f5f640e3d5cad64e9d9e7d422",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        65,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "4ca7600838e31b62353262eae380c9b43a42cea4034f7011f5fe12823314a1d9",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "「ん……%91_CALL_90%もうちょっと粘ってよ。ねえ、シュヴァお姉ちゃん、次は絶対来てね。無理しちゃだめだよ……？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fab7d0100e7853038b00c991d9e8e35d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        67
      ],
      "originalHash": "80f392f71e66a77ef9fec7d9c2d7ba3f9bc3bc0dcef352b5582a9f007096d0cf",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "言い終えると、%VIVLOS%は心配そうではあったが、笑って%CHARA%に手を振り、小走りに%VERXINA%の背を追った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "074b3f03140d025d647eb204a79cf27e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        83,
        "lines",
        5,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "7a693b1a0dc915c20ed64d995d6fe84f33f6e7bc2e8b320bf102949551d59870",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "私には%CALL_90%と%YOUNGER_SISTER%がいる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a187d92ea24a892496d83ad66daac317",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        83,
        "lines",
        6,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "bc55b4aab5f720a8beba23fa1b35ba779253665a914ce0c95add7498cda1b387",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "%CALL_90%の名前は%VERXINA%、%YOUNGER_SISTER%の名前は%VIVLOS%。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c1d62ad3addd7915a4693dc13bd683f5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        83,
        "lines",
        7,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "a773a6b839295e8f9e9f874832613249541d46860f25604c40252ee6eeecd92b",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "%THEY%は母みたいに……明るくて華やかで、人と話すのが上手。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "73bb48ef989c2123808e914a9c1327d5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        83,
        "lines",
        8,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "9609a7b5e22509d5487e497c26a6c80e520d1a3ff8828dfd3440ebf798b741ab",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "%THEY%二人は……私と正反対。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "70dd4404937def19d13223fd72dc44d5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec2",
        "lines",
        83,
        "lines",
        10,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "60711d18e07dca0d96a25802f1d773d4353c48864446702071458d87d2510a18",
      "sourceFileHash": "cdb5074644d46fa2b81e06ffc42a9d963b75df22b636b6a70f198793653756da",
      "originalText": "（女性の親戚「あらあら、%VERXINA%と%VIVLOS%じゃない。今日も華やかで可愛いわね！」）",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fd0733fe52a75b2181cd8e42b88bed22",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/108900-Cheval-Grand/rec-89.kojo",
      "key": "rec2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
